      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i feel like i've been sweating for hours and i'm really drained. i really dont want to wait for a doctor or go to a clinic just for cramps. if i take the 2000mg now, isn't that just helping my body get back to where it was? i'm pretty fit, surely my body can handle that much to stop these cramps ASAP.",
